        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgQrl1dl5Of7gF5fc-tEyJNbG8VX4s_PKZaF10u3V3Lduhfg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Kristine took care of our special needs cat for the third time.  As usual, our cat was well loved and cared for.  She offers a unique service to come to our home to feed and spend some time with our cat.  Our cat just loves her and her daughter.  A great service, by a lovely lady that can be trusted with your pets.",
        "time": 1725022507,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Viola Vakili",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103042191122739983797/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfXA3X6lEd4JNapdspHf7n-RPfW_rEwlkvC4MHbCbqcBXFOA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "One of my friends introduced Kristi to me a few months ago when I was looking for a reliable person to take care of my little spoiled dog. I started taking my dog to Kristi‘a place to socialize and get to know other people and dogs. I should say it’s a big relief to find a person I can fully trust, who is so careful and knowledgeable about dogs. I definitely recommend her to my friends.",
        "time": 1664671117,
        "translated": false
      },
